+	 * Now we have a combination of 2 conditions:			\
+	 *								\
+	 * 1) whether or not we need to apply a bias, and		\
+	 *								\
+	 * 2) whether or not there might be an overflow in the cross	\
+	 *    product determined by (___m & ((1 << 63) | (1 << 31))).	\
+	 *								\
